        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncifs: fix session state check in reconnect to avoid use-after-free issue\n\nDon't collect exiting session in smb2_reconnect_server(), because it\nwill be released soon.\n\nNote that the exiting session will stay in server-\u003esmb_ses_list until\nit complete the cifs_free_ipc() and logoff() and then delete itself\nfrom the list.",
          "title": "CVE description"
        }
      ],
